entative section of closest medial  red ink  margin F  representative section of medial superior fibrofatty tissue G  representative section of fibrous area in the superior lateral area Labeled  left axillary contents  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 5cm aggregate of fibrofatty tissue sectioned to reveal multiple tan pink lymph nodes  representative sections submitted in cassettes H L  Resident  MARISA BALDASSANO  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Jeffrey Schapiro MD Edwin Lee Carter  M D  PART A  MASS  LEFT BREAST   REEXCISION PART B  AXILLARY CONTENTS  LEFT    report_end  , Unchecked.
