ug Administration  FDA   The FDA has determined that such clearance or approval is not necessary  this laboratory has established and verified the test s accuracy and precision  Added by  Atul Kumar Bhan  M D  Signed On  30 REMOVED_MONTH 04 at 13 59     HER 2 Addendum     RESULTS OF FLUORESCENCE IN SITU HYBRIDIZATION  FISH  FOR HER 2 NEU GENE AMPLIFICATION Breast  Right  block B   HER 2 neu gene in tumor cells  REMOVED_DATE  Not Amplified   See note  Note  Results are expressed as the average ratio of HER 2 to chromosome 17 signals in 60 tumor cell nuclei  A ratio of greater than REMOVED_DATE or equal to REMOVED_DATE indicates HER 2 neu gene amplification adjusted for chromosome 17 polysomy using PathVysion by Vysis  Added by  Rosemary Tambouret MD Signed On  06 MAY 04 at 16 21 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number only  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 4 5cm right breast with a suture designating the 12 o clock aspect and a REMOVED_DATE x 6 5cm irregular to oval overlying portion of skin  No scar is identified  The centrally located nipple measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm and is slightly nodular  The remaining skin surface is unremarkable  No axillary tail is grossly appreciated  The anterior aspect is inked blue  the posterior black  the specimen is serially sectioned to reveal a well delineated tan pink indurated and lobulated homogeneous mass measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 5cm  The mass is located within the central portion of the specimen  abuts the overlying skin surface  comes to 0 4cm from the inferior portion of the blue inked anterior soft tissue margin  and 6 5cm from the unremarkable posterior margin  The remaining parenchyma is tan yellow to pink  lobulated and unremarkable with no additional discrete masses or lesions grossly appreciated  Along the periphery  no prominent lymph nodes are identified  Representative sections are submitted as follows  A  Closest posterior marg