h no additional discrete masses identified  The specimen is entirely submitted in cassettes M P with the mass entirely submitted in cassette N  Gross Description by  JENNIFER NASH Resident  RESIDENT FREE SERVICE  JHE                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART A  BREAST RIGHT  EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B  BREAST LEFT  EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART C  BREAST LEFT 12 00  EXCISIONAL BIOPSY , Checked.
