   In this laboratory  we also compared the results of staining of 100 routinely processed breast carcinomas with determinations of progesterone receptors by a hormone binding assay  Sixty five percent of tumors that stained with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  07 REMOVED_MONTH 98 at 09 15 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number only  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm breast biopsy that is inked and sectioned to reveal a slightly nodular and cystic breast parenchyma  submitted entirely in A H  Labeled with the patients name  unit number and  right nipple skin tag   is an unoriented fragment of soft tissue measuring 0 5cm in greatest diameter that is inked  bisected and submitted entirely in I  Resident  IVANA DELALLE  MD  PHD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     GROSS DIAGNOSIS   LEFT BREAST   NO LESION GROSSLY SUSPICIOUS FOR INVASIVE CARCINOMA  AWAIT PERMANENTS  O R  Resident  EDI BROGI  MD  PhD O R  Diagnosis by  ESTHER OLIVA  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT   BIOPSY PART B  SKIN  RIGHT NIPPLE    BIOPSY   report_end  , Unchecked.
