formance characteristics determined by the Pathology Department at the Massachusetts General Hospital  They have not been cleared or approved by the U S  Food and Drug Administration  FDA   The FDA has determined that such clearance or approval is not necessary  this laboratory has established and verified the test s accuracy and precision  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  06 REMOVED_MONTH 99 at 11 10 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  left sentinel lymph node  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm tan pink soft tissue fragment  which is entirely frozen as FX 1  and resubmitted as cassette A  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  left breast  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm breast tissue with long suture designating the lateral margin and short suture designating the superior margin  The deep margin is inked yellow and the anterior is inked black  Sectioning of the specimen reveals a tan white firm nodule measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 9cm  located 0 5cm from the deep margins  The other margins are more distant  The rest of the breast parenchyma is grossly unremarkable  No frozen section is done  Representative sections are as follows  B  Closest deep margin  C D  Rest of the nodule  E F  Parenchyma around the lesion  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  left breast final shaved margin  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm aggregate of fibroadipose tissue  entirely submitted in G H  Resident  MOHAMMAD MAHMOOD  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  LYMPH NODE  LEFT SENTINEL  THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  O R  Resident  TAI YUAN LIN  MD O R  Diagnosis by  John H  Eichhorn  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SU