ors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  08 AUG 97 at 14 25 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in frozen section lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  s name  unit number and  Left Breast  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 3cm portion of fibroadipose tissue with a hard  well defined  tan red REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm nodule that abuts the margin of excision  Representative sections of discrete nodule frozen as FX 1  now in A  remainder of nodule frozen in B E  The remainder of parenchyma is white and nodular and submitted entirely in F H  Resident  DANIELLE ELLIOTT  M D      INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  INVASIVE MAMMARY CARCINOMA O R  Resident  STUART HOUSER  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Lawrence R  Zukerberg  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Wiley W Souba Jr   M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY , Unchecked.
