e dome cysts are identified  Multiple lymph nodes are found within the axillary tail region  the largest of which measures 2 3cm in greatest dimension and the smallest measuring 0 1cm in diameter  Section Code  A B  incision region nipple region and underlying breast tissue and old biopsy site  C E  tissue from and adjacent to the old biopsy area  F  closest deep margin  G  inferior margin and adjacent representative breast tissue  H  upper medial quadrant  representative section  I  lower medial quadrant  representative section  J  upper lateral quadrant  representative section  K  lower lateral quadrant  representative section  L Q  axillary lymph nodes  Resident  C  Diana Jordan  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Charles Mason Ferguson  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT    report_end  , Unchecked.
